==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Cannot use [[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|Bebe]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Dessert Witch]] spawns as the boss after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dessert Witch - Obsession]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**20 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't very hard. The Dessert Witch has 380 range, meaning [[Dragon Cat]] can outrange everything here. Constant meatshielding and spamming Dragon should win.

